=== Prompt ===
Who is SpongeBob SquarePants?

=== Response ===
SpongeBob SquarePants is a popular animated character and the titular protagonist of an American animated television series of the same name. Created by marine biologist and cartoonist Stephen Hillenburg, the show first aired on Nickelodeon in 1999 and has since become one of the longest-running and most beloved children's shows.

SpongeBob is a yellow, anthropomorphic sponge who lives in a pineapple under the sea in the fictional underwater city of Bikini Bottom. He works as a fry cook at the Krusty Krab restaurant and is known for his optimistic outlook, catchy theme song, and humorous catchphrases like "Oh boy!" and "Just wait! I'm gonna getcha!"

The show is known for its quirky humor, memorable characters, and unique setting that blends elements of the ocean with a suburban American town. It has gained a wide and dedicated fanbase and has spawned various forms of media, including movies, books, and video games.

